{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Formal)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Formal)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The limit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/0/3c05738d56d63a22cea8ef2eb5eb6656ac37cae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {x^2-1}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"39\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> approaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as a limit is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51e6da28fbd81495cbdf7f3ecaed3711e8363ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Indeterminate} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x-1 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"473\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad6e43079bd612cd60c4e3ce94fc562626cf63ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim \\limits_{x\\to 1} (x^2-1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"29\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/734eeafd63fa217818a70b27cb3511db23887ff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim \\limits_{x\\to 1} (x-1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" />, by L'Hôpital's rule <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4bff0c59ccc9be9d617694db678c7c209d1efdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim \\limits_{x\\to 1}\\frac{x^2-1}{x-1} = \\lim \\limits_{x\\to 1}\\frac{2x}{1} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"243\" height=\"42\" />.\n</p><p>~ MATH__is__FUN\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a4ecb65de08c1bf479a1947129ae25b83e78bd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c6115ec72b24e7143d0baf3f93ae7ee6883c378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {x^2-1}{x-1} = \\frac{(x+1)(x-1)}{x-1} = x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"261\" height=\"42\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> approaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/8174461c9a6568e65fe09595c69f6e25b39f3981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {x^2-1}{x-1} = x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"121\" height=\"42\" /> approaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b79405be0b1ee41078698907e05641a09cc681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cxsmi\">cxsmi</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Formal.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Formal)\">Solution 3 (Formal)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Formal)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/4038e9921fbc9784f2e6c08b3c4444441fc7e478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{x^2-1}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"115\" height=\"42\" />.  Then if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a4ecb65de08c1bf479a1947129ae25b83e78bd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817b39da27bbca14354729d414bb6f9a7b0cca83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac {x^2-1}{x-1} = \\frac{(x+1)(x-1)}{x-1} = x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"320\" height=\"42\" />. \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce56cfc237a035a5b060ddc685c710b3fa4af2e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\epsilon &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> be any positive real number and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5632314a842d67e672616db6c23c09ed41bcfc6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta = \\epsilon$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />.  Then if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45baa69f6d0ab0e8aa0676f091b8197c0c322315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; |x-1| &lt; \\delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7fbba9b48f34f6578a2e2d5be085ec9622f3b52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-1| = |x+1-2| = |f(x)-2| &lt; \\delta = \\epsilon$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"327\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/cacd8b9fe4de5be590d467f397a86896893b279e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim \\limits_{x\\to 1}\\frac{x^2-1}{x-1} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"165\" height=\"42\" /> by the definition of the limit.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">Problem 41</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10